WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.730
<i>Ah yes, it's a great shield.</i>

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.770
<i>Worthy of Sazaki Susumu's little sister.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>But... what if i have a sword that exceeds its defensive strength!?</i>

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.160
There's no paradox!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.080
My shield!?

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.350
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.220
<i>The winner is team G-Master from the Miyazato Institute High School.</i>

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.060
<i>They will advance to the final round.</i>

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.520
Gyanko lost...

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.360
You were no match for us after all.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:01.240
Now do you understand how talentless you all are?

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.330
Stop it, Sakashita.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.920
You were talking big, but played so badly.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:10.550
That girl!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.630
That's so uncool!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:16.340
You may as well give up Gunpla Bat--

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.220
Wh-What are you doing!?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.180
Don't mock opponents who fought seriously.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:28.400
If you do that, it dimisnishes you as a person, Understand?

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.570
What he just said is true of everything in battle.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:39.490
Suga Akira...  he's definitely for real.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.040
He's a fighting man.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.560
I'm sorry that I'm not Sekai.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.900
I tried to bring him here, but...

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.690
<i>He said, "I won't talk to her now."</i>

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.820
<i>"That's what a fighter should do."</i>

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.740
"I'd rather meet Gyanko again in battle."

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:52.580
Gyanko?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.420
I have an idea...

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.760
For the new Gunpla I'm gonna build.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:01.880
What?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:05.510
From today's defeat, I've come up with a new idea!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.390
I have to go home and build it right away.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.140
I'll defeat the Miyazato Institute next time for sure!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.480
Miss Fumina, you too.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.230
And Sekai as well!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.110
Gosh...

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.990
<i>You're still bluffing.</i>

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.830
<i>But you're pretty cool...</i>

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.160
<i>Gyanko.</i>

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.010
The Miyazato Institute's machines are...

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.090
a Hyaku-Shiki, a V Gundam and a G-Fighter.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.510
They're all tuned to a high degree.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.100
Hoshino.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.940
I want to fight Suga Akira's machine in the final round.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.350
The G-Fighter?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.610
The Build Burning has no long-range weapons. You can't handle it.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.820
Leave it to Hoshino's Winning.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.070
I'll...

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.700
Welcome...

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.160
Hi.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.370
That guy...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.040
We me at G-Muse.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.330
Do you remember me?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.500
I'm Sakai Minato from Osaka.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.250
What's your name?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.260
I-I'm Fumina Hoshino.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.970
What a charming name. I think I'm falling for you.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.220
So who are you?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:27.930
Shut up!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.390
Miss Fumina.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.310
I saw your Winning Gundam that you made.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.690
A great customization that utilizes the SD's characteristics.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.150
Especially how the head turns into a core fighter--

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.060
Sakai Minato!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.480
Don't interrupt our nice conversation.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.030
The Miyazato Institute's Hyaku-Shiki.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.070
That's your work, right?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.120
Well done, Kousaka Yuuma. What great insight.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.410
You could become a Newtype.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.450
Be serious! What are you up to?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.290
There's no meaning to it whatsoever.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.920
I've know Mr. Sudou from the Miyazato Institute a long time.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.710
He asked me to build a Gunpla for the championship.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.630
Is this your revenge because I'm playing Gunpla Battle again?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.180
You're so full of yourself. It's just a coincidence.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.010
But great timing.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.270
Not only in contest, but in battle as well,

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.560
I'll prove that Gunpla I build are superior to yours.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:20.980
I don't intend to lose.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.190
Then, good luck.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.530
I'll look forward to the final match.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.000
Oh!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.000
Oh, it hurts.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.170
It hasn't stopped swelling yet.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.760
When Sakashita gets really angry, she doesn't stop there.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.510
I bet she likes you.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.470
But she hasn't come to the club room since then.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.760
She's being shy.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.720
Don't worry. She'll come to the final round.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.770
I trust her that much.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:03.190
Say, you went to the national tournament last year, right?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.190
Yeah...

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.570
It was my first national tournament.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.780
And it was my first time fighting at damage level A.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.990
I took the national tournament too lightly.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.620
To think that the Gunpla I made was so useless...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.170
I felt the limits of my own Gunpla,

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:31.970
and asked Sakai Minato of the Shingyo school to build one for the championship.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.100
Build it yourself, and fight for yourself...

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.020
Even if I'm ignoring the theory of Gunpla Battle,

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.020
I just want to win.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.980
It's my third year of high school. This is my last tournament.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.530
Whatever it takes, I must...

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.530
Don't worry, we're gonna win.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.700
That's right.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.370
Let's believe that.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.960
Three days untill the final round of the qualifiers.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.420
It's too late to start fretting.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.050
Maintain your Gunpla, be careful with your heatlh,

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.840
and then play the match.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.300
I know, but...!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.890
Jigen Haoh style of Kenpo. right?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.890
It won't work on me, though.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.230
Those words stick in my mind.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.440
If what Suga Akira said is true...

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.780
Practicing alone?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.570
Izuna Shimon!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.120
You guys only have three members, right?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.870
Want me to practice with you?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.040
Are you sure?

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.540
There's one more coming.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.750
I couldn't keep my promise, but...

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.260
I thought I could at least help you.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.680
Thank you!

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.220
Wow, your little brother made it to the final round?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.060
Yes.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:04.140
So can I have a day off from work this Sunday?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.770
Go ahead and cheer him on.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:07.770
Right!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.920
Sakashita isn't here.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.920
We have no choice, I'd better join--

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.090
<i>There's no need.</i>

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.970
Sorry about the other day.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.100
I won't look down on my opponent anymore.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:52.230
I'll never give up, and I'll give it my all.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.280
Miss Yomi.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.450
That's right. Let's win this and head to the Nationals!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.370
Yeah!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.620
Sekai. Yuu...

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.290
If we win this match, we can go to the national tournament.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.250
We'll win.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:13.340
To keep my promise and get back what I had lost.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.300
I want to win, too.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.470
To get one step closer to that person.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.100
I want excitement.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:26.730
In the nationals, I'll fight amazing battles with amazing people.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.400
I want to go there.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.980
Let's win this, and go to the nationals!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:32.980
Yeah!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.980
Team Try Fighters!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.530
Go fight!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:42.160
<i>We now begin the final round of the West Tokyo qualifiers.</i>

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.120
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, start up.</i>

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.790
<i>Model damage level, set to B.</i>

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.300
<i>Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.590
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.890
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.680
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.060
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.110
Hoshino Fumina, Winning Gundam!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.320
Kousaka Yuuma, Lightning Gundam!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.570
Kamiki Sekai, Build Burning Gundam!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.660
Team Try Fighters!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.830
Let's go!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.710
It's begun at last...

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.090
The final battle.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.510
Space fortress Solomon...

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.970
There are two strategies.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.430
You fight inside the fortress, or...

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.600
Or else you fight outside.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.480
Lightning will go around Solomon and suprise the enemy team.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.480
Sekai and I will take the route goes through Solomon.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.230
Don't get taken out, Yuuma.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.610
The blunder I made in the quaterfinals...

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.660
I won't ever repeat it again!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.240
He's fast.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.030
Is that it?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.120
Enemy detected.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.330
That speed. Is it the G-Fighter...?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.460
No.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.340
It's Minato's Hyaku-Shiki.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.760
As I expected, the Grand Prix holder is scouting ahead!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.010
Only one machine?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.470
Where're the other two!?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.510
A message from Yuu...

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.640
He can't see two of the enemy machines.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:33.600
An attack!?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.730
So soon?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.440
We only just entered Solomon!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.150
The G-Fighter!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.610
I see, it's towing the V Gundam.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.450
<i>Here I come. Suga Akira.</i>

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.030
Sekai!?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:47.990
Take this!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.950
Jigen Haoh style!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.960
Soten Guren-Ken!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.960
<i>Soten Guren-Ken: Blue Sky Crimson Lotus Fist</i>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.340
I told you, Gundam boy.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.090
The Jigen Haoh style won't work on me.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.300
I know that technique, too!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.140
Then...

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.140
how about this!?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.480
Watch out!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.520
Sekai.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.440
That technique!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.030
I know that!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.200
What!?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.740
Pinpoint shield defense!?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.500
Why you!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:37.920
Sekai, this way!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:39.790
Roger that.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:59.060
Worthy of a Grand Prix holder!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.940
The output's evenly matched!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.150
No way. I'm from the Shingyo school.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:04.820
What!?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.080
A particle transformation saber!?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.330
Sudou, the enemy machines are about to come outside.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.420
Roger that.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.390
Mega Launcher, firing mode.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.310
We lost contact with Yuu...!?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.190
Sekai, let's get out of Solomon!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.110
<i>Alright!</i>

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.870
Mega Launcher.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:52.870
Fire!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.580
I won't let you!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.830
That's my line!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.020
What's that?

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.980
A mega particle cannon!? Run!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.980
Not so fast!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.190
What?

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.450
How dare you... !

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.870
Give up already!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.670
I got you.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.080
What?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.170
No way...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.050
Impossible. Imagine a builder sacrificing his Gunpla.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:52.930
<i>No.</i>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.970
I'm a fighter now!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.930
President!

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:01.980
Yuu!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.940
Taking his opponent with him...!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.820
Did he beat Sudou?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.820
No. But...

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.990
I've had enough!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.160
Hoshino!?

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:24.880
Yes!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.880
Go!!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:27.500
What!?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.770
Jigen Haoh style!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.270
<i>Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri: Whirlwind Spinning Kick</i>

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.270
A Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.070
Seiken-Zuki!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.070
<i>Seiken-Zuki: Holy Fist Punch</i>

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.110
What!?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:16:59.700
Yes!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:00.740
No way.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.670
Miss Yomi, are you alive?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.210
I can move my upper body. I won't give up.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.250
I'll give it my all until the end!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.380
That's the spirit!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.180
Th-They docked!?

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.220
Those guys!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.730
Yeah, we're not finished yet!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.530
Sekai!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.950
We won't give up!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.490
At this rate...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.410
<i>Se...kai...</i>

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.780
<i>...Sekai...</i>

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.160
You're finished now!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.160
<b>You're finished now!</b>

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:51.550
What!?

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.180
Go, Sekai!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.100
Sekai! Use this.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.020
You're still going!?

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.440
We can still...

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.690
We can still do it!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.900
Isn't that right, Build Burning!?

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.790
The particles that Build Burning is emitting...!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.120
It's turning red... like a flame.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.710
What's that!?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.380
A suicide attack!?

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.890
Let's go, Build Burning!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.690
Hoshino, Yuuma and I are all together!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.860
Together...

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:03.780
Together, we will win!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.120
The winner is--

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.830
Us!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.510
Th-This light...

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.060
It's the radiance of human and machine together as one!

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:30.810
Then blaze on, Gunpla!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.840
I-It worked...

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.470
We won.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:12.640
Not so!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.270
The match wasn't called yet.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:20.780
Th-That's...!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.330
I threw away my pride as a builder,

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.540
and even fought using another person's machine...

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.130
<i>all for the sake of victory.</i>

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.090
<i>To go to that place again...</i>

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.510
To get to...

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.560
the nationals!

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.220
